<section class="section cdcp2">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="cdcp2__heading">"Won't the Canadian Dental Care Plan Fill the Gap?"</h2>
    <div class="cdcp2__cols">
      <div class="cdcp2__text">
        <h4>We still need your help.</h4>
        <p>Groups that will not be covered under public dental programs including the Canadian Dental Care Plan (CDCP) are:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Low-income Canadians who do not file their taxes with the CRA</li>
          <li>Migrant Workers</li>
          <li>People experiencing Homelessness</li>
          <li>Displaced Persons &amp; Refugees</li>
          <li>People who cannot access public dental programs due to long wait lists, accessibility barriers, limited dental services offered, or challenges finding a dental office that accepts public dental programs.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cdcp2__img"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/Dental-care-plan-1024x683-1.webp' | url }}" alt="" width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cdcp2__note"><p>Filling the Gap Dental Outreach is <strong>NOT</strong> able to accommodate patients with CDCP coverage. If you believe you have urgent dental care needs, and are not able to access oral care through the CDCP, please contact us for next steps.</p></div>
    <div class="cdcp2__btn"><a class="btn btn--sm" href="https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/dental/dental-care-plan/apply.html">Check If You Are Eligible</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
